  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The enediol is more stable as compared to other tautomers because the enol form is more stabilized by a favorable intramolecular hydrogen bond. This makes vitamin C to exist as conjugates ene-diol and, not as keto tautomer.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0063_469373931ec6.png\" style=\"width: 302px; height: 170px;\" />&nbsp;</p>"
